claims.text:
Kae Capital is delighted to double down on Cüraa as the company raises its ₹40 crore Series A, led by @3one4Capital. The round also sees continued participation from Kae Capital, @Lumikai and @better_capital.

@SanjyotKeer, @NeerajUdai and the team have built strong traction by combining a deep understanding of the consumer with disciplined execution across product, supply chain and distribution. Cüraa has now served over 3 lakh households, and we believe they are only getting started.

Excited
